      "summary_en": "Kha'Zix leaps to an area, dealing physical damage upon landing. If he chooses to Evolve Wings, Leap's range increases by 200 and the cooldown resets on champion kill or assist.",
      "summary_zh": "卡兹克跳向一个区域，在着陆时造成物理伤害。如果他选择进化虫翼的话，跃击的距离会提升200并在击杀和助攻时重置冷却时间。",
