      ],
      "summary_en": "Each rank allows Kha'Zix to evolve one of his abilities, giving it a unique additional effect. When activated, Kha'Zix becomes Invisible, triggering Unseen Threat and increasing Move Speed. If he chooses to Evolve Adaptive Cloaking, Void Assault gains increased Invisibility duration, and an additional use.",
      "summary_zh": "每升一级此技能都会允许卡兹克进化他的一项技能，给予该技能独特的附加效果。在激活【虚空来袭】时，会使卡兹克变成隐形状态，触发无形威胁并提升移动速度。如果他选择进化动态遮蔽的话，【虚空来袭】获得已提升的隐形持续时间，以及一次额外的使用次数。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": []
